@startuml recognition-flow
title Speech Recognition Flow

actor User
participant "Keyboard/App" as App
participant "MainRecognitionService" as Service
participant "SileroVAD" as VAD
participant "WhisperRepository" as Repo
participant "WhisperContext" as Context
participant "whisper.cpp (JNI)" as Native

== Initialization ==
App -> Service: startListening()
Service -> Repo: getWhisperContext()
Repo -> Context: Load model from preferences
Context -> Native: initContext(modelPath)
Native --> Context: contextPtr

== Audio Capture ==
loop Recording
    Service -> Service: Record 16kHz PCM audio
    Service -> VAD: detectSpeech(audioChunk)
    alt Speech detected
        VAD --> Service: isSpeaking = true
        Service -> Service: Buffer audio
    else Silence detected
        VAD --> Service: isSpeaking = false
        Service -> Service: End segment
    end
end

== Transcription ==
Service -> Repo: transcribeAudio(audioBuffer)
Repo -> Repo: Convert ShortArray to FloatArray
Repo -> Repo: Normalize to [-1.0, 1.0]
Repo -> Repo: Pad if < 2 seconds
Repo -> Context: transcribeData(floatArray)
Context -> Native: fullTranscribe(contextPtr, audio)
Native -> Native: Run Whisper inference
Native --> Context: segmentCount
loop For each segment
    Context -> Native: getTextSegment(index)
    Native --> Context: text
end
Context --> Repo: transcription
Repo -> Repo: Remove hallucination artifacts
Repo --> Service: cleanedText

== Result Delivery ==
Service --> App: onResult(transcription)
App -> App: Insert text

@enduml
